 86	
 87	**vs. Executing Plans (parallel session):**
 88	- Same session (no context switch)
 89	- Fresh subagent per task (no context pollution)
 90	- Two-stage review after each task: spec compliance first, then code quality
 91	- Faster iteration (no human-in-loop between tasks)
